window.TGW_SCOPE="guide";window.TGW_LANG="ms";window.TGW_DICT={"1. Connect an account":"1. Sambungkan akaun","2. Check the connection route":"2. Semak laluan sambungan","3. Export and verify":"3. Eksport dan sahkan","4. Protect storage":"4. Lindungi storan","<a href=\"#why\">Why not your main account</a><a href=\"#api\">Public app pairs</a><a href=\"#number\">Ways to create an extra account</a><a href=\"#setup\">Creating the account</a><a href=\"#services\">Number services</a>":"<a href=\"#why\">Mengapa bukan akaun utama anda</a><a href=\"#api\">Pasangan aplikasi awam</a><a href=\"#number\">Cara-cara untuk mencipta akaun tambahan</a><a href=\"#setup\">Mencipta akaun</a><a href=\"#services\">Nombor perkhidmatan</a>","<strong>Choose the workspace and scope.</strong> Each workspace belongs to one Telegram account and has its own sources, settings, journal, queue, and signing key. Add as many workspaces as you need.":"<strong>Pilih ruang kerja dan skop.</strong> Setiap ruang kerja milik satu akaun Telegram dan mempunyai sumber, tetapan, jurnal, barisan, dan kunci tandatangan sendiri. Tambah sebanyak mana ruang kerja yang anda perlukan.","<strong>Exports</strong> provides ZIP, JSONL, CSV, HTML, a checkpoint and a signed run receipt. Exports cover a full journal prefix for the selected workspace, regardless of search filters.":"<strong>Eksport</strong> menyediakan ZIP, JSONL, CSV, HTML, satu titik pemeriksaan dan resit pelaksanaan yang disahkan. Eksport merangkumi awalan jurnal penuh untuk ruang kerja yang dipilih, tanpa mengira penapis carian.","<strong>Pause observation</strong> stops collection. <strong>Lock</strong> only closes browser access. Closing the tab does not stop the process. Events may be missed during downtime; a current-history snapshot cannot reconstruct every deletion or intermediate edit.":"<strong>Menangguhkan pemerhatian</strong> menghentikan pengumpulan. <strong>Mengunci</strong> hanya menutup akses pelayar. Menutup tab tidak menghentikan proses. Acara mungkin terlepas semasa waktu henti; snapshot sejarah semasa tidak dapat membina semula setiap pemadaman atau suntingan pertengahan.","<strong>Pause observation</strong> stops that collector. <strong>Lock</strong> and closing a tab do not stop collection; switching workspaces only changes the view. Stopping the Python process stops all workspaces. After a restart, observation resumes and asks Telegram for the updates missed while it was off.":"<strong>Menangguhkan pemerhatian</strong> menghentikan pengumpul tersebut. <strong>Mengunci</strong> dan menutup tab tidak menghentikan pengumpulan; menukar ruang kerja hanya mengubah paparan. Menghentikan proses Python menghentikan semua ruang kerja. Selepas dihidupkan semula, pemerhatian disambung dan meminta kemas kini yang terlepas semasa ia dimatikan daripada Telegram.","<strong>Review outcomes and gaps.</strong> Attachments download separately when enabled. A queued attachment is not yet preserved. An explicit history snapshot saves current visible messages and cannot reconstruct missed changes.":"<strong>Semak keputusan dan kekosongan.</strong> Lampiran dimuat turun secara berasingan apabila diaktifkan. Lampiran yang diletakkan dalam barisan masih belum disimpan. Sisipan sejarah eksplisit menyimpan mesej yang kelihatan pada masa ini dan tidak dapat membina semula perubahan yang terlepas.","<strong>Save the collection policy.</strong> Select new messages, edits, deletions, reactions, and membership events as needed. Settings apply to the workspace's selected sources. Re-enabling a category does not recover missed events.":"<strong>Simpan dasar pengumpulan.</strong> Pilih mesej baru, suntingan, pemadaman, reaksi, dan acara keahlian mengikut keperluan. Tetapan terpakai pada sumber terpilih di ruang kerja. Mengaktifkan semula kategori tidak memulihkan acara yang terlepas.","<strong>Start observation.</strong> Updates from the active account client become separate signed records. An edit adds a version; a deletion notice does not erase text already captured. Unknown editors and deletion actors stay unknown.":"<strong>Mulakan pemerhatian.</strong> Kemas kini daripada klien akaun aktif menjadi rekod berasingan yang disahkan. Suntingan menambah versi; notis pemadaman tidak memadam teks yang telah dirakam. Penyunting dan pelaku pemadaman yang tidak diketahui kekal tidak diketahui.","<strong>Storage protection</strong> shows the vault mode. Sessions and secrets are encrypted. Messages, attachments and exports require protected storage such as an encrypted disk/volume. An evidence ZIP is not an encrypted application backup.":"<strong>Perlindungan storan</strong> menunjukkan mod peti besi. Sesi dan rahsia disulitkan. Mesej, lampiran dan eksport memerlukan storan terlindung seperti cakera/jumlah yang disulitkan. ZIP bukti bukan sandaran aplikasi yang disulitkan.","<strong>scripts\\Demo.cmd</strong> opens a local fictional workspace without copying a token. Real workspaces still need their panel token because the panel controls account authorizations and private records. This is separate from Telegram login.":"<strong>scripts\\Demo.cmd</strong> membuka ruang kerja rekaan tempatan tanpa menyalin token. Ruang kerja sebenar masih memerlukan token panel mereka kerana panel mengawal kebenaran akaun dan rekod peribadi. Ini berasingan daripada log masuk Telegram.","A GitHub token grants repository access; it does not prove that the running server is unchanged. Build verification and independent witnesses provide different checks. No GitHub token is needed on this page.":"Token GitHub memberikan akses ke repositori; ia tidak membuktikan bahawa pelayan yang sedang berjalan tidak berubah. Pengesahan binaan dan saksi bebas menyediakan semakan yang berbeza. Tiada token GitHub diperlukan di halaman ini.","A Telegram account needs a phone number that receives the login code. Choose by how long the account has to live.":"Akaun Telegram memerlukan nombor telefon yang menerima kod log masuk. Pilih tempoh hayat akaun tersebut.","A bot in your channel":"Bot dalam saluran anda","A failed proxy does not trigger a direct fallback. Pause observation before changing routes; saving cancels unfinished login. <strong>Test Telegram connection</strong> can run before sign-in; it checks transport, not complete update delivery.":"Proksi yang gagal tidak mencetuskan fallback langsung. Hentikan pemerhatian sebelum menukar laluan; menyimpan membatalkan log masuk yang belum selesai. <strong>Ujian sambungan Telegram</strong> boleh dijalankan sebelum log masuk; ia memeriksa pengangkutan, bukan penghantaran kemas kini sepenuhnya.","A failed proxy never falls back to a direct connection":"Proksi yang gagal tidak akan kembali kepada sambungan terus","A prepaid SIM or eSIM when the account has to live long; a rental or a one-time activation for a short job. Services are listed below.":"SIM prabayar atau eSIM apabila akaun perlu bertahan lama; penyewaan atau pengaktifan sekali sahaja untuk kerja jangka pendek. Perkhidmatan disenaraikan di bawah.","A retained signed check lets you compare a later export with the journal as it was observed. It does not establish that every Telegram event was delivered. Unavailable checks and failed posts need attention; there is no guarantee of uninterrupted publication.":"Satu cek bertandatangan yang disimpan membolehkan anda membandingkan eksport kemudian dengan jurnal seperti yang diperhatikan. Ia tidak membuktikan bahawa setiap peristiwa Telegram telah disampaikan. Cek yang tidak tersedia dan kiriman yang gagal memerlukan perhatian; tiada jaminan penerbitan tanpa gangguan.","A session file, TData ZIP or session text, plus its JSON if you have one.":"Fail sesi, ZIP TData atau teks sesi, serta JSON-nya jika ada.","A session grants account access. Keep original and converted files private. Conversion transfers authorization, not message history, and cannot restore a revoked login.":"Sesi memberikan akses akaun. Kekalkan fail asal dan terjemahan secara peribadi. Penukaran memindahkan kebenaran, bukan sejarah mesej, dan tidak dapat memulihkan log masuk yang ditarik balik.","A signature establishes integrity relative to the trusted key, not Telegram origin. Retain the fingerprint and checkpoint independently. An RFC 3161 request alone is not a trusted timestamp; obtain and verify the authority's reply.":"Tandatangan menetapkan integriti berbanding kunci yang dipercayai, bukan asal Telegram. Kekalkan cap jari dan titik pemeriksaan secara berasingan. Permintaan RFC 3161 sahaja bukan cap masa yang dipercayai; peroleh dan sahkan balasan pihak berkuasa.","API ID and API hash are optional":"ID API dan hash API adalah pilihan","About 99% of accounts logged out":"Kira-kira 99% akaun telah log keluar","Account":"Akaun","Account JSON":"JSON Akaun","Account formats":"Format akaun","Account self-destruct":"Akaun bunuh diri","Accounts are banned simply because Telegram does not trust them, and such bans are frequent. You can check this too. Using your own account is a really stupid idea.":"Akaun diharamkan semata-mata kerana Telegram tidak mempercayainya, dan larangan sedemikian kerap berlaku. Anda juga boleh menyemak perkara ini. Menggunakan akaun sendiri adalah idea yang sangat bodoh.","Accounts are often supplied as <code>name.session</code> plus <code>name.json</code>. Select both together: the JSON supplies <code>app_id</code>/<code>app_hash</code>; other fields such as phone, device or a stored 2FA password are ignored, and TgWitness asks for 2FA when Telegram requires it.":"Akaun sering dibekalkan sebagai <code>name.session</code> plus <code>name.json</code>. Pilih kedua-duanya bersama: JSON membekalkan <code>app_id</code>/<code>app_hash</code>; medan lain seperti telefon, peranti atau kata laluan 2FA yang disimpan diabaikan, dan TgWitness meminta 2FA apabila Telegram memerlukannya.","Activations":"Aktivasi","Add accounts with the <strong>+</strong> button beside the account selector or through <strong>Workspaces</strong>. Other collectors keep running when you switch views.":"Tambah akaun dengan butang <strong>+</strong> di sebelah pemilih akaun atau melalui <strong>Workspaces</strong>. Pengumpul lain terus berjalan apabila anda menukar paparan.","After launch, check the first signed post in your channel. The host runs the checks; the bot publishes their result. Another host and operator make the witness more independent.":"Selepas pelancaran, semak kiriman pertama yang ditandatangani dalam saluran anda. Hos menjalankan pemeriksaan; bot menerbitkan hasilnya. Satu hos dan pengendali lain menjadikan saksi lebih bebas.","All workspaces stop":"Semua ruang kerja berhenti","Animations always on":"Animasi sentiasa dihidupkan","Approved version":"Versi diluluskan","As long as you keep it topped up":"Selagi anda terus menambah baki","Attachments":"Lampiran","Auth key":"Kunci Auth","Auxiliary <code>python -m tgwitness…</code> commands need the project environment: replace <code>python</code> with <code>.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe</code> on Windows or <code>.venv/bin/python</code> on Linux/macOS, or activate .venv first.":"Pembantu <code>python -m tgwitness…</code> perintah memerlukan persekitaran projek: gantikan <code>python</code> dengan <code>.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe</code> pada Windows atau <code>.venv/bin/python</code> pada Linux/macOS, atau aktifkan .venv terlebih dahulu.","Back to panel":"Kembali ke panel","Back to top":"Kembali ke atas","Backups":"Sandaran","Bans just for low trust are frequent":"Larangan hanya kerana tahap kepercayaan rendah adalah kerap","Best choice":"Pilihan terbaik","Both versions stay in the journal":"Kedua-dua versi kekal dalam jurnal","Browsers with file-streaming support ask you to choose a destination first and write data as it arrives. Other browsers buffer at most 128 MiB. For larger files, use the streaming CLI while the server is running:":"Pelayar yang menyokong penstriman fail meminta anda memilih destinasi terlebih dahulu dan menulis data sebaik sahaja ia tiba. Pelayar lain memperbufer sehingga 128 MiB. Untuk fail yang lebih besar, gunakan CLI penstriman semasa pelayan sedang berjalan:","Build check":"Bina semak","Built-in pool":"Kolam terbina dalam","Cheap":"Murah","Check that the installed build matches that version.":"Semak bahawa binaan yang dipasang sepadan dengan versi tersebut.","Check the displayed account ID. Open <strong>Sources</strong>: your chats load automatically. Add the sources your account can access.":"Semak ID akaun yang dipaparkan. <strong>Sumber</strong> Terbuka: sembang anda dimuat secara automatik. Tambah sumber yang akaun anda boleh akses.","Checkpoint":"Pemeriksaan","Choose a sign-in method":"Pilih kaedah log masuk","Choose how this workspace reaches Telegram, then test it before signing in.":"Pilih cara ruang kerja ini mengakses Telegram, kemudian uji ia sebelum log masuk.","Choose your channel and check interval, then save the configuration.":"Pilih saluran dan selang semakan anda, kemudian simpan konfigurasi.","Choose your fork and approve a specific version.":"Pilih fork anda dan luluskan versi tertentu.","Close the privacy settings":"Tutup tetapan privasi","Close the tab":"Tutup tab","Collection continues":"Pengumpulan diteruskan","Collection stops":"Pengumpulan berhenti","Collector":"Pengumpul","Commands need the project environment":"Perintah memerlukan persekitaran projek","Connect":"Sambung","Connect a dedicated account, never your main one. <a href=\"/dedicated-account.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Why, and how to get one ↗</a>":"Sambungkan akaun khusus, bukan akaun utama anda. <a href=\"/dedicated-account.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Mengapa, dan cara mendapatkannya ↗</a>","Connect it to TgWitness":"Sambungkannya ke TgWitness","Continue":"Teruskan","Copied":"Disalin","Copied to clipboard.":"Disalin ke papan klip.","Copy":"Salin","Create read-only access for the selected account and save its access file.":"Buat akses baca sahaja untuk akaun yang dipilih dan simpan fail aksesnya.","Created at my.telegram.org from the account.":"Dicipta di my.telegram.org daripada akaun.","Creating an authorization key":"Mencipta kunci kebenaran","Creating the account":"Mencipta akaun","Creating your own app hash: obtaining api_id":"Mencipta hash aplikasi anda sendiri: mendapatkan api_id","Dark theme":"Tema gelap","Dedicated account guide":"Panduan akaun khusus","Deleted":"Dihapuskan","Deletion notice":"Notis pemadaman","Demo mode":"Mod demo","Direct":"Langsung","Download":"Muat turun","Download the journal and let others check that nothing was changed.":"Muat turun jurnal tersebut dan biarkan orang lain memeriksa bahawa tiada apa-apa yang diubah.","Each workspace supports Direct, SOCKS5, HTTP CONNECT and experimental MTProxy. MTProxy accepts a 16-byte hex key or dd + key. Fake TLS ee secrets are unsupported. Stored proxy passwords/secrets are never returned to the panel.":"Setiap ruang kerja menyokong Direct, SOCKS5, HTTP CONNECT dan MTProxy eksperimental. MTProxy menerima kunci heksadesimal 16 bait atau dd + kunci. Rahsia TLS palsu tidak disokong. Kata laluan/rahsia proksi yang disimpan tidak akan dikembalikan ke panel.","Edit · version 2":"Sunting · versi 2","Edited":"Disunting","Encrypted by TgWitness":"Disulitkan oleh TgWitness","Enter them under <strong>API ID + Hash</strong>, then sign in with your phone number and login code, scan a QR code with an already-signed-in Telegram app, or import a session. API credentials identify your application; they do not provide access to an account by themselves.":"Masukkan mereka di bawah <strong>ID API + Hash</strong>, kemudian log masuk dengan nombor telefon dan kod log masuk anda, imbas kod QR dengan aplikasi Telegram yang sudah log masuk, atau import sesi. Kredensial API mengenal pasti aplikasi anda; ia tidak memberikan akses ke akaun dengan sendirinya.","Enter your phone number and press <strong>Continue</strong>, select <strong>Files → Connect account</strong>, or choose <strong>QR code → Show QR code</strong>.":"Masukkan nombor telefon anda dan tekan <strong>Teruskan</strong>, pilih <strong>Fail → Sambungkan akaun</strong>, atau pilih <strong>Kod QR → Tunjukkan Kod QR</strong>.","European mobile numbers in an app":"Nombor mudah alih Eropah dalam aplikasi","Every change becomes a signed record":"Setiap perubahan menjadi rekod yang disahkan","Every change becomes its own signed record. Nothing captured is overwritten.":"Setiap perubahan menjadi rekod berasingan yang ditandatangani. Tiada apa yang dirakam akan ditimpa.","Every request and answer is encrypted with the session's authorization key, not with the API hash. Knowing the API hash decrypts nothing.":"Setiap permintaan dan jawapan disulitkan dengan kunci kebenaran sesi, bukan dengan hash API. Mengetahui hash API tidak dapat menyahsulitkan apa-apa.","Export":"Eksport","Export and verify":"Eksport dan sahkan","Exports":"Eksport","External master key":"Kunci induk luaran","Extra account on public pairs":"Akaun tambahan pada pasangan awam","Extras":"Tambahan","Files":"Fail","Files: what to select and how they are checked":"Fail: apa yang perlu dipilih dan bagaimana ia disemak","For another workspace, add <code>--profile PROFILE_ID</code>. The ID appears at the top of <strong>Exports → Workspace ID</strong>. See all command options with:":"Untuk ruang kerja lain, tambah <code>--profile PROFILE_ID</code>. ID muncul di bahagian atas <strong>Eksport → ID Ruang Kerja</strong>. Lihat semua pilihan arahan dengan:","For backup, stop the process cleanly and preserve the whole data directory, all workspaces and required keys. Temporary exports use each workspace's <code>temporary-exports/</code>; interrupted export files are cleaned on the next startup.":"Untuk sandaran, hentikan proses dengan lancar dan pelihara keseluruhan direktori data, semua ruang kerja dan kunci yang diperlukan. Eksport sementara menggunakan setiap ruang kerja <code>temporary-exports/</code>; fail eksport yang terhenti akan dibersihkan pada permulaan seterusnya.","Forum list of official app pairs, published for registering accounts":"Senarai forum pasangan aplikasi rasmi, diterbitkan untuk mendaftarkan akaun","Four ways in. Use the one that matches what you already have.":"Empat cara untuk masuk. Gunakan yang sepadan dengan apa yang anda sudah ada.","Free number":"Nombor percuma","From a number to the first recorded chat.":"Daripada nombor ke sembang pertama yang direkodkan.","From account connection to a verifiable journal":"Dari sambungan akaun ke jurnal yang boleh disahkan","From the project directory, run:":"Dari direktori projek, jalankan:","GETTING STARTED":"MULA","Get a number":"Dapatkan nombor","GitHub & verified builds":"GitHub & binaan yang disahkan","Give it a neutral profile":"Berikan profil neutral","Guide sections":"Bahagian panduan","How TgWitness works":"Bagaimana TgWitness berfungsi","How observation works":"Bagaimana pemerhatian berfungsi","I have a .session file or TData ZIP":"Saya mempunyai fail .session atau TData ZIP","I have an Auth Key (HEX) and DC ID":"Saya mempunyai Kunci Auth (HEX) dan ID DC","I only have an API ID and API Hash":"Saya hanya mempunyai ID API dan Hash API","In <strong>Files</strong>, choose one session format: Telethon/Pyrogram <code>.session</code>, TData ZIP, or Telethon StringSession text. Add its companion JSON if supplied; you do not need every session format. Select up to four matching files, totaling at most 8 MiB, then press <strong>Connect account</strong>. Use <strong>Passcode or session text</strong> for a protected TData archive or a session string. Conversion runs in memory on your own TgWitness server without saving uploads, extracting ZIPs, or contacting a conversion service. The Connect button then checks the account with Telegram. To read files without authorization, use <strong>Passcode or session text → Read files without signing in</strong>. Conflicting files are rejected; imported user IDs are checked online.":"Dalam <strong>Fail</strong>, pilih satu format sesi: Telethon/Pyrogram <code>.session</code>, TData ZIP, atau teks Telethon StringSession. Tambah JSON pendampingnya jika disediakan; anda tidak memerlukan setiap format sesi. Pilih sehingga empat fail yang sepadan, dengan jumlah maksimum 8 MiB, kemudian tekan <strong>Hubungkan akaun</strong>. Gunakan <strong>Kode Akses atau teks sesi</strong> untuk arkib TData yang dilindungi atau rentetan sesi. Penukaran dijalankan dalam memori pada pelayan TgWitness anda sendiri tanpa menyimpan muat naik, mengekstrak fail ZIP, atau menghubungi perkhidmatan penukaran. Butang Connect kemudian menyemak akaun dengan Telegram. Untuk membaca fail tanpa kebenaran, gunakan <strong>Kod Laluan atau teks sesi → Baca fail tanpa log masuk</strong>. Fail yang bertembung ditolak; ID pengguna yang diimport disemak dalam talian.","In <strong>Sources → Capture settings → Choose which changes to preserve</strong>, select event categories or use <strong>Messages, edits &amp; deletions</strong>, then save monitoring settings.":"Di <strong>Sumber → Tetapan Rakaman → Pilih perubahan yang ingin dikekalkan</strong>, pilih kategori acara atau gunakan <strong>Mesej, suntingan &amp; pemadaman</strong>, kemudian simpan tetapan pemantauan.","In Telegram":"Di Telegram","In its own workspace, connect with <strong>Account → QR code</strong>, then press <strong>Sources → Investigation mode</strong>. The app is where you act, TgWitness is the record.":"Di ruang kerja anda sendiri, sambungkan dengan <strong>Akaun → Kod QR</strong>, kemudian tekan <strong>Sumber → Mod Siasatan</strong>. Aplikasi adalah tempat anda bertindak, TgWitness adalah rekodnya.","Install TgWitness on the witness host, add your BotFather token and follow the launch commands in step 3.":"Pasang TgWitness pada hos saksi, tambahkan token BotFather anda dan ikuti arahan pelancaran dalam langkah 3.","Integrity confirmed":"Integriti disahkan","JSON is limited to one object of 64 KiB. TData ZIPs are limited to 512 entries and 32 MiB expanded size, with 64 KiB authorization files. Close the original SQLite client and create a consistent copy; do not discard an unfinished WAL to bypass validation.":"JSON terhad kepada satu objek bersaiz 64 KiB. TData ZIP terhad kepada 512 entri dan saiz pengembangan 32 MiB, dengan fail kebenaran bersaiz 64 KiB. Tutup klien SQLite asal dan buat salinan yang konsisten; jangan buang WAL yang belum selesai untuk memintas pengesahan.","Join a few chats a day at first. New accounts that rush are limited first.":"Sertailah beberapa perbualan sehari pada mulanya. Akaun baru yang tergesa-gesa akan dihadkan terlebih dahulu.","Journal":"Jurnal","Keep it from self-destructing":"Hindarkan ia daripada memusnahkan diri sendiri","Keep signed checks outside the collector.":"Simpan cek bertandatangan di luar pengumpul.","Keep signed proof copies through an independent witness.":"Simpan salinan bukti yang ditandatangani melalui saksi bebas.","Keep the fingerprint":"Simpan cap jari","Know which software made the record.":"Ketahuilah perisian yang mencipta rekod tersebut.","Language":"Bahasa","Lasts":"Tahan lama","Let it warm up":"Biarkan ia memanas","Libraries and discussions":"Perpustakaan dan perbincangan","Light theme":"Tema ringan","Limits at a glance":"Had pada sekilas pandang","Load a closed, consistent schema 7/8 file directly. The optional Telethon-only CLI converter also accepts files up to 64 MiB.":"Muatkan fail skema 7/8 tertutup dan konsisten secara langsung. Penukar CLI pilihan hanya untuk Telethon juga menerima fail sehingga 64 MiB.","Load a schema 2/3 production user session. The panel detects its contents; renaming a file is not conversion.":"Muat sesi pengguna pengeluaran skema 2/3. Panel mengesan kandungannya; menamakan semula fail bukanlah penukaran.","Load supported Telethon/Pyrogram SQLite or TData ZIP directly with its optional JSON companion. A separate API pair is optional; imported or saved settings take precedence over the built-in pool. For an offline Telethon-only conversion, close its original client and use a consistent copy:":"Muatkan Telethon/Pyrogram SQLite atau TData ZIP yang disokong secara langsung dengan pendamping JSON pilihan. Pasangan API berasingan adalah pilihan; tetapan yang diimport atau disimpan diutamakan berbanding kolam terbina dalam. Untuk penukaran luar talian Telethon sahaja, tutup klien asalnya dan gunakan salinan yang konsisten:","Lock":"Kunci","Lock it with a cloud password":"Kunci dengan kata laluan awan","Logging in to my.telegram.org from an account you have no access to, to get an app hash, and then any request through that app hash means a 99% chance the account is logged out. You can check it.":"Log masuk ke my.telegram.org daripada akaun yang anda tidak mempunyai akses, untuk mendapatkan hash aplikasi, dan kemudian sebarang permintaan melalui hash aplikasi itu bermakna terdapat 99% kemungkinan akaun tersebut telah dilog keluar. Anda boleh menyemakinya.","Logout errors: AUTH_KEY_UNREGISTERED, SESSION_REVOKED":"Ralat log keluar: AUTH_KEY_UNREGISTERED, SESSION_REVOKED","MTProto encryption":"Sulitan MTProto","MTProxy · experimental":"MTProxy · eksperimental","Main account":"Akaun utama","Many countries":"Banyak negara","Many different programs":"Banyak program yang berbeza","Many expect standard geographic or political blocks, such as OFAC lists or regional bans against Russia. TgWitness enforces none of them: it is released under the MIT License for everyone, in every country.":"Ramai menjangkakan sekatan geografi atau politik standard, seperti senarai OFAC atau larangan serantau terhadap Rusia. TgWitness tidak menguatkuasakan mana-mana daripadanya: ia dikeluarkan di bawah Lesen MIT untuk semua orang, di setiap negara.","Mathematics and cryptographic truth belong to everyone across the globe.":"Matematik dan kebenaran kriptografi adalah milik semua orang di seluruh dunia.","Meet at 10:00":"Bertemu pada pukul 10:00","Meet at 11:00":"Bertemu pada pukul 11:00","Message deleted":"Mesej telah dipadam","Messages":"Mesej","Missed updates are requested":"Kemas kini yang terlepas diminta","Monitoring settings":"Tetapan pemantauan","Monitoring settings apply to the selected sources in the current account, survive restart, and record signed before/after changes. Keep new messages enabled for comparison context. Re-enabling a category does not recover missed events. Explicit history snapshots and operational diagnostics remain separate.":"Tetapan pemantauan terpakai pada sumber yang dipilih dalam akaun semasa, kekal selepas permulaan semula, dan merekod tandatangan sebelum/selepas perubahan. Kekalkan mesej baru diaktifkan untuk konteks perbandingan. Mengaktifkan semula kategori tidak memulihkan acara yang terlepas. Snapshot sejarah eksplisit dan diagnostik operasi kekal berasingan.","Needs an encrypted disk":"Perlukan cakera yang disulitkan","Never delete or replace <code>vault.key</code>: you would lose access to sessions and signing keys.":"Jangan sekali-kali memadam atau menggantikan <code>vault.key</code>: anda akan kehilangan akses kepada sesi dan kunci penandatanganan.","Never press “Share phone number” or “Share location” for a bot. Open links and Mini Apps through a VPN or proxy on that device.":"Jangan sekali-kali menekan \"Berkongsi nombor telefon\" atau \"Berkongsi lokasi\" untuk bot. Buka pautan dan Mini Apps melalui VPN atau proksi pada peranti tersebut.","New installations may use an external master key through <code>TGWITNESS_VAULT_KEY_FILE</code>. Do not delete vault.key or replace an existing installation's key: doing so can destroy access to sessions and signing keys.":"Pemasangan baharu boleh menggunakan kunci induk luaran melalui <code>TGWITNESS_VAULT_KEY_FILE</code>. Jangan padamkan vault.key atau menggantikan kunci pemasangan sedia ada: berbuat demikian boleh memusnahkan akses kepada sesi dan kunci tandatangan.","New message":"Mesej baru","News channel":"Saluran berita","No name, photo, username or bio from your other accounts, no personal contacts.":"Tiada nama, foto, nama pengguna atau bio daripada akaun lain anda, tiada kenalan peribadi.","Nobody can see anything of yours through them":"Tiada siapa pun dapat melihat apa-apa daripada anda melalui mereka","Number rental":"Nombor penyewaan","Number rental and activations <span class=\"count\">12</span>":"Nombor penyewaan dan aktivasi <span class=\"count\">12</span>","Number services":"Nombor perkhidmatan","OPTIONAL EXTRAS":"PENAMBAHAN PILIHAN","Observe":"Perhatikan","Observing":"Mengamati","Obtaining api_id":"Memperoleh api_id","One code":"Satu kod","One new application, one account":"Satu aplikasi baharu, satu akaun","One panel token controls every workspace. Account separation is not a separate-user permission system. An existing journal cannot be reassigned to another Telegram account.":"Satu token panel mengawal setiap ruang kerja. Pemisahan akaun bukan sistem kebenaran pengguna berasingan. Jurnal sedia ada tidak boleh dipindahkan ke akaun Telegram lain.","One-time":"Satu kali","One-time activation":"Aktivasi sekali sahaja","Only Telegram traffic uses it: this is not a system VPN":"Hanya trafik Telegram yang menggunakannya: ini bukan VPN sistem","Only the view changes":"Hanya pandangan yang berubah","Only your account sees which app it is":"Hanya akaun anda yang dapat melihat aplikasi mana ia","Open <strong>Account</strong> and select <strong>Phone</strong>, <strong>QR code</strong>, <strong>Files</strong>, or <strong>Auth key</strong>. To use your own application, open <strong>API ID + Hash</strong> in the form and enter its credentials. You can paste one <code>app_id:app_hash</code> pair into API ID. This workspace reuses its saved pair or falls back to the built-in pool.":"Buka <strong>Akaun</strong> dan pilih <strong>Telefon</strong>, <strong>Kod QR</strong>, <strong>Fail</strong>, atau <strong>Kunci Auth</strong>. Untuk menggunakan aplikasi anda sendiri, buka <strong>ID API + Hash</strong> dalam borang dan masukkan kelayakan aksesnya. Anda boleh menampal satu <code>app_id:app_hash</code> pasangan ke dalam ID API. Ruang kerja ini menggunakan semula pasangan yang disimpannya atau kembali kepada kolam terbina dalam.","Open <strong>Account</strong>. If needed, configure a proxy first under <strong>Settings → Connection settings → Change connection route</strong>.":"Buka <strong>Akaun</strong>. Jika perlu, atur proxy terlebih dahulu di bawah <strong>Tetapan → Tetapan sambungan → Ubah laluan sambungan</strong>.","Open Extras in the panel and choose Set up a bot. The form prepares the files for a separate witness process.":"Buka Extras di panel dan pilih Set up a bot. Borang ini menyediakan fail untuk proses saksi berasingan.","Open Where the list comes from for providers, saved dates and the download route. Unavailable sources keep their previous entries. You can also enter your own proxy or use an operator catalog.":"Buka di mana senarai itu berasal untuk penyedia, tarikh yang disimpan dan laluan muat turun. Sumber yang tidak tersedia mengekalkan entri sebelumnya. Anda juga boleh memasukkan proksi anda sendiri atau menggunakan katalog pengendali.","Open to everyone":"Terbuka kepada semua","Operational records and other group service events remain separate from the event switches. Captured messages can retain embedded reaction or membership metadata. Some deletion notices do not identify a chat; they are saved as unscoped account-level notices without guessing a source.":"Rekod operasi dan acara perkhidmatan kumpulan lain kekal berasingan daripada suis acara. Mesej yang dirakam boleh mengekalkan metadata reaksi atau keahlian yang disematkan. Sesetengah notis pemadaman tidak mengenal pasti sembang; ia disimpan sebagai notis peringkat akaun tanpa skop tanpa meneka sumbernya.","Optionally enter your own API ID/hash from <a href=\"https://my.telegram.org\" rel=\"noreferrer\">my.telegram.org</a>; otherwise a pair from the built-in pool is used. Complete code/2FA or QR confirmation in an already-signed-in Telegram app. Saved API credentials are reused within this workspace.":"Secara pilihan, masukkan ID/hash API anda sendiri dari <a href=\"https://my.telegram.org\" rel=\"noreferrer\">my.telegram.org</a>; jika tidak, sepasang daripada kolam terbina dalam akan digunakan. Lengkapkan kod/2FA atau pengesahan QR dalam aplikasi Telegram yang sudah log masuk. Butiran API yang disimpan akan digunakan semula dalam ruang kerja ini.","Options to start from. Countries, prices and whether Telegram accepts a number change often; check before paying.":"Pilihan untuk bermula. Negara, harga dan sama ada Telegram menerima perubahan nombor sering berubah; semak sebelum membayar.","Other countries":"Negara lain","Other formats":"Format lain","Other workspaces, remote servers and limits":"Ruang kerja lain, pelayan jauh dan had","Our advice not to use your main account is not a joke. It is reality.":"Nasihat kami untuk tidak menggunakan akaun utama anda bukanlah gurauan. Ia adalah realiti.","Over a million accounts registered":"Lebih sejuta akaun telah didaftarkan","Over a million accounts registered through these pairs":"Lebih sejuta akaun didaftarkan melalui pasangan ini","PLANNED":"RANCANGAN","Pages":"Halaman","Paid":"Dibayar","Paste an authorized session string or load a plain-text <code>.tgwitness-session</code> or <code>.txt</code> file, up to 4 KiB.":"Tempelkan rentetan sesi yang dibenarkan atau muatkan teks biasa <code>.tgwitness-session</code> atau <code>.txt</code> fail, sehingga 4 KiB.","Pause observation":"Jeda pemerhatian","Pause, lock and downtime":"Pause, kunci dan masa henti","PayGo plan, very cheap":"Pelan PayGo, sangat murah","Phone":"Telefon","Phone number <strong>Nobody</strong>, find me by my number <strong>My contacts</strong>, last seen, profile photos and bio <strong>Nobody</strong> or <strong>My contacts</strong>; turn contact sync off.":"Nombor telefon <strong>Tiada siapa</strong>, cari saya melalui nombor saya <strong>Kenalan saya</strong>, terakhir dilihat, foto profil dan bio <strong>Tiada siapa</strong> atau <strong>Kenalan saya</strong>; matikan penyegerakan kenalan.","Phone number, code, and optional two-step verification":"Nombor telefon, kod, dan pengesahan dua langkah pilihan","Phone, QR code or session file":"Telefon, kod QR atau fail sesi","Planned · approved versions and proof copies.":"Versi yang dirancang · diluluskan dan salinan bukti.","Prepaid":"Prabayar","Prepaid SIM and eSIM <span class=\"count\">11</span>":"SIM prabayar dan eSIM <span class=\"count\">11</span>","Prepaid SIM or eSIM":"SIM prabayar atau eSIM","Privacy settings":"Tetapan privasi","Proof copies":"Salinan bukti","Proxies":"Proksi","Proxy formats, public lists and testing":"Format proksi, senarai awam dan pengujian","Public MTProxy lists are built in":"Senarai MTProxy awam dibina dalam","Public MTProxy lists are included. Open Account → Settings → Connection settings → Change connection route, choose a server and save it. Update public lists downloads fresh addresses while keeping your selected route.":"Senarai MTProxy awam disertakan. Akaun → Tetapan → Tetapan sambungan → Ubah laluan sambungan, pilih pelayan dan simpannya. Kemas kini senarai awam memuat turun alamat baharu sambil mengekalkan laluan yang anda pilih.","Public pairs of the pool":"Pasangan awam kolam","Pyrogram SQLite .session":"Pyrogram SQLite .session","QR code":"Kod QR","QR login":"Log masuk QR","Quit Telegram Desktop, then ZIP only <code>key_datas</code> and the 16-character file ending in <code>s</code> beside it (usually <code>D877F783D5D3EF8Cs</code>) from the <code>tdata</code> folder; the whole folder with its cache is usually too large. Supply the Desktop local passcode if one is set. One account per archive; legacy layouts, multi-account folders, and encrypted ZIP containers are unsupported.":"Tutup Telegram Desktop, kemudian ZIP sahaja <code>key_datas</code> dan fail 16 aksara yang berakhir dengan <code>s</code> di sebelahnya (biasanya <code>D877F783D5D3EF8Cs</code>) daripada <code>tdata</code> folder; keseluruhan folder dengan cache-nya biasanya terlalu besar. Sediakan kod laluan tempatan Desktop jika ditetapkan. Satu akaun setiap arkib; susun atur lama, folder berbilang akaun, dan bekas ZIP yang disulitkan tidak disokong.","Read before you connect an account":"Bacalah sebelum anda menyambungkan akaun","Register apart from your main account":"Daftar berasingan daripada akaun utama anda","Register in the official Telegram app on a separate device, emulator or phone profile, not next to your main account.":"Daftar dalam aplikasi Telegram rasmi pada peranti berasingan, emulator atau profil telefon, bukan bersebelahan akaun utama anda.","Reliability: high":"Kebolehpercayaan: tinggi","Reliability: low":"Kebolehpercayaan: rendah","Reliability: medium":"Kebolehpercayaan: sederhana","Rental":"Sewaan","Rental keeps a number for weeks or months. A one-time activation gives a single code: set the cloud password right after registering.":"Sewaan mengekalkan nombor selama berminggu-minggu atau berbulan-bulan. Pengaktifan sekali sahaja memberikan satu kod: tetapkan kata laluan awan sebaik sahaja mendaftar.","Replace the example DC ID with the supplied value, from 1 to 5. An optional numeric <code>user_id</code> is checked during authorization. Keep this JSON private; it grants account access. A JSON containing only <code>app_id</code> and <code>app_hash</code> supplies app settings and still needs a session or phone/QR login.":"Gantikan ID DC contoh dengan nilai yang disediakan, dari 1 hingga 5. Numerik pilihan <code>user_id</code> diperiksa semasa pengesahan. Jaga JSON ini secara peribadi; ia memberi akses akaun. JSON yang mengandungi hanya <code>app_id</code> dan <code>app_hash</code> menyediakan tetapan aplikasi dan masih memerlukan log masuk sesi atau telefon/QR.","Restart":"Mulakan semula","Right away set a cloud password and a recovery email used nowhere else.":"Segera tetapkan kata laluan awan dan emel pemulihan yang tidak digunakan di tempat lain.","Run receipt":"Jalankan resit","Runs on your computer or server":"Berjalan pada komputer atau pelayan anda","SQLite via the CLI converter":"SQLite melalui penukar CLI","Saved proxy passwords and secrets are never shown again":"Pasword dan rahsia proksi yang disimpan tidak akan dipaparkan lagi","Scan it with a Telegram app that is already signed in.":"Imbas ia dengan aplikasi Telegram yang sudah log masuk.","Secrets":"Rahsia","Secrets are encrypted for you. Messages and files need an encrypted disk.":"Rahsia disulitkan untuk anda. Mesej dan fail memerlukan cakera yang disulitkan.","Select <strong>Auth key</strong>, paste the complete key, and choose the supplied DC ID (1–5). Optionally enter User ID to check the account identity. Your own API ID and Hash are optional. Press <strong>Connect account</strong>. An Auth Key contains 512 hexadecimal characters; an API Hash contains 32. Shortened keys containing <code>...</code> cannot work.":"Pilih <strong>kunci Auth</strong>, tampal kunci lengkap, dan pilih ID DC yang disediakan (1–5). Secara pilihan, masukkan ID Pengguna untuk menyemak identiti akaun. ID API dan Hash anda sendiri adalah pilihan. Tekan <strong>Sambungkan akaun</strong>. Kunci Auth mengandungi 512 aksara heksadesimal; Hash API mengandungi 32. Kunci dipendekkan yang mengandungi <code>...</code> tidak boleh berfungsi.","Select QR code, press Show QR code and confirm in an already-authorized Telegram app under Settings → Devices → Link Desktop Device. Enter two-step verification if requested. Expired codes can be regenerated.":"Pilih kod QR, tekan Tunjukkan kod QR dan sahkan dalam aplikasi Telegram yang sudah dibenarkan di bawah Tetapan → Peranti → Pautkan Peranti Desktop. Masukkan pengesahan dua langkah jika diminta. Kod yang tamat tempoh boleh dijana semula.","Selected — Ctrl/Cmd+C":"Dipilih — Ctrl/Cmd+C","Server deployment":"Penyebaran pelayan","Server examples are included under <code>deploy/</code>, with full instructions in <code>docs/DEPLOYMENT.md</code>. Platform qualification and live Telegram acceptance are documented separately; TgWitness does not guarantee universal compatibility or complete capture.":"Contoh pelayan disertakan di bawah <code>deploy/</code>, dengan arahan penuh dalam <code>docs/DEPLOYMENT.md</code>. Kelayakan platform dan penerimaan Telegram langsung didokumenkan secara berasingan; TgWitness tidak menjamin keserasian sejagat atau tangkapan sepenuhnya.","Service events, pausing and the panel token":"Acara perkhidmatan, penggantian dan token panel","Session + JSON pair":"Pasangan sesi + JSON","Sessions":"Sesi","Set account self-destruct to the longest period, so a stopped TgWitness does not cost you the account.":"Atur pemusnahan akaun ke tempoh terpanjang, supaya TgWitness yang dihentikan tidak menyebabkan anda kehilangan akaun.","Set the attachment policy separately, then press <strong>Start observation</strong>.":"Tetapkan dasar lampiran secara berasingan, kemudian tekan <strong>Mulakan pemerhatian</strong>.","Settings → Devices of your own account lists each session's app name and API ID, device, IP address and dates. Nobody else gets this list.":"Tetapan → Peranti pada akaun anda menyenaraikan nama aplikasi dan ID API setiap sesi, peranti, alamat IP dan tarikh. Tiada siapa lain mendapat senarai ini.","Setup guide":"Panduan persediaan","Several accounts":"Beberapa akaun","Share nothing with bots":"Jangan kongsi apa-apa dengan bot","Sign in directly in Account. Telegram chooses how the code is delivered; SMS is not guaranteed.":"Masuk terus dalam Akaun. Telegram memilih cara kod dihantar; SMS tidak dijamin.","Sign in, choose your chats and start observing.":"Log masuk, pilih sembang anda dan mula memerhati.","Signatures can be checked independently":"Tandatangan boleh disemak secara bebas","Signed journal":"Jurnal bertandatangan","Signing in creates an authorization key by a Diffie–Hellman exchange between your TgWitness and Telegram; the key itself is never sent. Telegram's documentation: after authorization the key becomes associated with the user, and every call with this key runs as that user. Other programs with the same pair have their own keys and cannot use yours.":"Log masuk menghasilkan kunci kebenaran melalui pertukaran Diffie–Hellman antara TgWitness dan Telegram anda; kunci itu sendiri tidak pernah dihantar. Dokumentasi Telegram: selepas kebenaran, kunci itu menjadi dikaitkan dengan pengguna, dan setiap panggilan dengan kunci ini dijalankan sebagai pengguna tersebut. Program lain dengan pasangan yang sama mempunyai kunci mereka sendiri dan tidak dapat menggunakan kunci anda.","Sources":"Sumber","Spam FAQ: virtual numbers and previous owners":"FAQ Spam: nombor maya dan pemilik terdahulu","Stack Overflow: should the api_hash be kept secret?":"Stack Overflow: patutkah api_hash disimpan secara rahsia?","Start observation":"Mulakan pemerhatian","Start simple. Add what you need.":"Mulakan dengan mudah. Tambah apa yang anda perlukan.","Stop the Python process":"Hentikan proses Python","Storage":"Penyimpanan","Support group":"Sokongan kumpulan","Supported fields include api_id/app_id, api_hash/app_hash, Telethon StringSession, or complete 512-character Auth Key HEX with dc_id. A companion JSON may contain only API metadata; load it with a session or use phone/QR login.":"Medan yang disokong termasuk api_id/app_id, api_hash/app_hash, Telethon StringSession, atau Kunci Auth HEX lengkap 512-karakter dengan dc_id. JSON rakan kongsi hanya boleh mengandungi metadata API; muatkannya dengan sesi atau gunakan log masuk telefon/QR.","Supported formats":"Format yang disokong","Switch workspace":"Tukar ruang kerja","System theme":"Tema sistem","TDLib, Pyrogram StringSession, CSV/JSON bulk account lists, and bots are unsupported. Add each account in its own workspace.":"TDLib, Pyrogram StringSession, senarai akaun pukal CSV/JSON, dan bot tidak disokong. Tambah setiap akaun dalam ruang kerja sendiri.","TData ZIP, expanded":"TData ZIP, diperluas","Team chat":"Sembang Pasukan","Telegram":"Telegram","Telegram Desktop TData ZIP":"Telegram Desktop TData ZIP","Telegram account":"Akaun Telegram","Telegram apps' open source code":"Kod sumber terbuka aplikasi Telegram","Telegram asks for the API ID and API hash when a program connects and when it requests a login code. They identify the application and give no access to any account; Telethon's documentation notes that one pair works with any phone number.":"Telegram meminta ID API dan hash API apabila program menyambung dan apabila ia meminta kod log masuk. Mereka mengenal pasti aplikasi dan tidak memberikan sebarang akses kepada mana-mana akaun; dokumentasi Telethon menyatakan bahawa satu pasangan berfungsi dengan mana-mana nombor telefon.","Telegram documentation":"Dokumentasi Telegram","Telegram has no method that lists accounts, sessions or messages by API ID. The owner of a pair sees only its app settings at my.telegram.org.":"Telegram tidak mempunyai kaedah yang menyenaraikan akaun, sesi atau mesej mengikut ID API. Pemilik sepasang hanya melihat tetapan aplikasi mereka di my.telegram.org.","Telegram may refuse a virtual number, not deliver the code or limit the new account at once; some apps take back numbers that are not used.":"Telegram mungkin menolak nombor maya, tidak menghantar kod atau mengehadkan akaun baru serta-merta; sesetengah aplikasi mengambil balik nombor yang tidak digunakan.","Telethon SQLite .session":"Telethon SQLite .session","Telethon StringSession":"Telethon StringSession","Telethon: signing in":"Telethon: menandatangani masuk","Text selected. Copy it manually.":"Teks telah dipilih. Salin secara manual.","TgWitness · Dedicated account":"TgWitness · Akaun khusus","TgWitness · Setup guide":"TgWitness · Panduan pemasangan","That is why we built TgWitness on public app hash/app ID pairs. By our logic, bans are less likely with them: more than a million Telegram accounts have been registered through these pairs, and many different programs work through them. By our logic, this is better than working directly with a personal app hash: these pairs have been alive for 5+ years for sure.":"Itulah sebabnya kami membina TgWitness pada pasangan hash aplikasi/ID aplikasi awam. Menurut logik kami, larangan kurang mungkin berlaku dengan mereka: lebih daripada sejuta akaun Telegram telah didaftarkan melalui pasangan ini, dan banyak program berbeza berfungsi melalui mereka. Menurut logik kami, ini lebih baik daripada bekerja terus dengan hash aplikasi peribadi: pasangan ini sudah wujud selama lebih 5 tahun dengan pasti.","The check tests dependencies, signing support, disk writes, the address/port and key configuration without Telegram login. An occupied port may mean another instance is running. Choose another <code>--port</code> or stop the previous process.":"Pemeriksaan ini menguji kebergantungan, sokongan penandatanganan, penulisan cakera, alamat/port dan konfigurasi kunci tanpa log masuk Telegram. Port yang diduduki mungkin bermakna instans lain sedang berjalan. Pilih yang lain <code>--port</code> atau hentikan proses sebelumnya.","The collector runs as a separate process. Your browser controls it and displays saved observations.":"Pengumpul dijalankan sebagai proses berasingan. Pelayar anda mengawalnya dan memaparkan pemerhatian yang disimpan.","The complete 512-character hex key with its DC ID, from 1 to 5.":"Kunci heksadesimal lengkap 512 aksara dengan ID DCnya, dari 1 hingga 5.","The most reliable: Telegram accepts real mobile numbers best. A number the carrier takes back goes to someone else.":"Yang paling boleh dipercayai: Telegram menerima nombor mudah alih sebenar dengan terbaik. Nombor yang diambil semula oleh pembekal akan diberikan kepada orang lain.","The number is taken back if you do not use it":"Nombor akan diambil semula jika anda tidak menggunakannya","The number returns to the pool at once, often with a history of previous owners. Set the cloud password before anything else.":"Nombor itu kembali ke kolam dengan segera, seringkali dengan sejarah pemilik sebelumnya. Tetapkan kata laluan awan sebelum apa-apa lagi.","The only incompatibility we name is <strong>Taylor Wessing</strong> and anyone who believes their words or authority stand above mathematics: those who enable or defend corporatocracy, privatized or commercial justice, plutocracy, kleptocracy and institutional corruption. Truth is available to all, except to those who think their signature under a lie turns it into reality.":"Satu-satunya ketidakserasian yang kami nyatakan ialah <strong>Taylor Wessing</strong> dan sesiapa yang percaya kata-kata atau kuasa mereka mengatasi matematik: mereka yang membolehkan atau mempertahankan korporatokrasi, keadilan yang diprivatisasi atau bersifat komersial, plutokrasi, kleptokrasi dan rasuah institusi. Kebenaran tersedia untuk semua, kecuali bagi mereka yang menyangka tandatangan mereka di bawah kebohongan menjadikannya kenyataan.","The owner of a pair sees nothing":"Pemilik sepasang tidak melihat apa-apa","The pair is a name, not a key":"Pasangan adalah nama, bukan kunci","The pair names the application. It never unlocks an account.":"Pasangan itu menamakan aplikasi. Ia tidak pernah membuka kunci akaun.","The pairs have been alive for 5+ years":"Pasangan-pasangan ini telah wujud selama lebih 5 tahun","The pairs of official Telegram apps are public and built into many independent programs and libraries:":"Pasangan aplikasi rasmi Telegram adalah awam dan terbina dalam banyak program dan perpustakaan bebas:","The rental period":"Tempoh sewaan","The result grants account access. Do not run concurrent clients using cloned authorizations. QR attempts are cancelled by lock, workspace switch, route change, or a new login; a closed/reloaded tab may leave an attempt pending until expiry.":"Hasilnya memberikan akses akaun. Jangan jalankan klien serentak menggunakan kebenaran klon. Percubaan QR dibatalkan oleh kunci, pertukaran ruang kerja, perubahan laluan, atau log masuk baru; tab yang ditutup/di-refresh mungkin meninggalkan percubaan menunggu sehingga tamat tempoh.","The same pairs in other programs <span class=\"count\">7</span>":"Pasangan yang sama dalam program lain <span class=\"count\">7</span>","The same pairs many programs use.":"Pasangan yang sama digunakan oleh banyak program.","The token is sent in an HTTP header, not in the URL or command arguments. For a remote server, add <code>--url https://your-server</code>. The default transfer limit is 5 GiB, configurable with <code>--max-mib</code>. Signed ZIP content has a separate 4 GiB uncompressed limit. Existing output files are not overwritten.":"Token dihantar dalam header HTTP, bukan dalam URL atau argumen arahan. Untuk pelayan jauh, tambah <code>--url https://your-server</code>. Had pemindahan lalai ialah 5 GiB, boleh dikonfigurasikan dengan <code>--max-mib</code>. Kandungan ZIP yang ditandatangani mempunyai had berasingan 4 GiB tanpa pemampatan. Fail output sedia ada tidak akan dioverwrite.","Theme":"Tema","This configures the Telegram client, not a system VPN. Remote access to the web panel needs HTTPS or an SSH tunnel.":"Ini mengkonfigurasikan klien Telegram, bukan VPN sistem. Akses jauh ke panel web memerlukan HTTPS atau terowong SSH.","This connection is planned and cannot be enabled yet. Its purpose is to record the approved source version, check the installed build and retain signed proof copies in a repository you control.":"Sambungan ini dirancang dan belum boleh diaktifkan. Tujuannya adalah untuk merekodkan versi sumber yang diluluskan, memeriksa binaan yang dipasang dan menyimpan salinan bukti yang ditandatangani dalam repositori yang anda kawal.","This guide ships with the application. No external scripts, fonts or analytics.":"Panduan ini disertakan bersama aplikasi. Tiada skrip, fon atau analitik luaran.","This is accurate information. We know exactly where the pitfalls of these problems are.":"Ini adalah maklumat yang tepat. Kami tahu dengan tepat di mana perangkap masalah-masalah ini terletak.","This is our position as the authors of TgWitness, not a licence condition. <a href=\"https://phishdestroy.github.io/TgWitness/docs/reference/license/\">Read our full notice</a>":"Ini adalah pendirian kami sebagai pengarang TgWitness, bukan syarat lesen. <a href=\"https://phishdestroy.github.io/TgWitness/docs/reference/license/\">Baca notis penuh kami</a>","Three commands answer most startup questions.":"Tiga arahan menjawab kebanyakan soalan permulaan.","Traffic is encrypted with your key":"Lalu lintas disulitkan dengan kunci anda","Troubleshoot startup":"Selesaikan masalah permulaan","Troubleshooting":"Pemecahan Masalah","Trusted fingerprint":"Cap jari dipercayai","Two-step verification":"Pengesahan dua langkah","US only; registration needs a US number":"AS sahaja; pendaftaran memerlukan nombor AS","Use a separate account. <span class=\"accent\">Never your main one.</span>":"Gunakan akaun berasingan. <span class=\"accent\">Jangan sekali-kali akaun utama anda.</span>","User authorization: the key becomes the user":"Pengesahan pengguna: kunci menjadi pengguna","Using it is a really stupid idea":"Menggunakannya adalah idea yang sangat bodoh","Vault mode":"Mod Vault","Verify":"Verifikasi","Verify using a trusted copy of the program:":"Sahkan menggunakan salinan program yang dipercayai:","Virtual number app":"Aplikasi nombor maya","Virtual number apps <span class=\"count\">20</span>":"Aplikasi nombor maya <span class=\"count\">20</span>","Virtual numbers":"Nombor maya","Watch out":"Berhati-hati","Ways to create an extra account":"Cara untuk membuat akaun tambahan","What a session record holds":"Apa yang direkodkan oleh rekod sesi","What does the bot actually prove?":"Apakah yang sebenarnya dibuktikan oleh bot ini?","What keeps collecting":"Apa yang terus dikumpul","What the check tests":"Apa yang diuji oleh pemeriksaan","When it ends, the number goes to the next customer.":"Apabila ia berakhir, nombor itu beralih kepada pelanggan seterusnya.","Where do we meet?":"Di mana kita bertemu?","While the app keeps the number":"Walaupun aplikasi mengekalkan nombor","Whoever holds the number later can request a login code. A cloud password (two-step verification) stops them from signing in; without it the account belongs to the next owner of the number.":"Sesiapa yang memegang nombor itu kemudian boleh meminta kod log masuk. Kata laluan awan (pengesahan dua langkah) menghalang mereka daripada log masuk; tanpanya akaun itu milik pemilik nombor seterusnya.","Why TgWitness works through public app hash/app ID pairs":"Mengapa TgWitness berfungsi melalui pasangan hash aplikasi/ID aplikasi awam","Why nobody can see anything of yours through these pairs":"Mengapa tiada siapa pun dapat melihat apa-apa daripada anda melalui pasangan ini","Why not your main account":"Mengapa bukan akaun utama anda","With a trial period":"Dengan tempoh percubaan","Witness host":"Host saksi","Working for 5+ years":"Beroperasi selama 5+ tahun","You can also save an account JSON with the fields below and select it in <strong>Files</strong>, replacing the example values with your own:":"Anda juga boleh menyimpan JSON akaun dengan medan di bawah dan memilihnya dalam <strong>Fail</strong>, menggantikan nilai contoh dengan nilai anda sendiri:","Your bot":"Bot anda","Your bot, in three steps.":"Bot anda, dalam tiga langkah.","Your channel":"Saluran anda","Your fork":"Pucuk anda","Your number, the login code and, if set, your two-step verification password.":"Nombor anda, kod log masuk dan, jika ditetapkan, kata laluan pengesahan dua langkah anda.","Your own <strong>API ID and API hash</strong> are optional. When no pair is entered, imported or saved in the workspace, TgWitness picks one from a built-in pool of public pairs and tries the next if Telegram refuses it. API settings identify the application; they do not replace account authorization. The TgWitness panel token opens the panel and is separate from Telegram login.":"<strong>ID API dan hash API</strong> anda sendiri adalah pilihan. Apabila tiada pasangan dimasukkan, diimport atau disimpan dalam ruang kerja, TgWitness akan memilih satu daripada kumpulan pasangan awam terbina dalam dan mencuba pasangan seterusnya jika Telegram menolaknya. Tetapan API mengenal pasti aplikasi; ia tidak menggantikan kebenaran akaun. Token panel TgWitness membuka panel dan berasingan daripada log masuk Telegram.","Your own app hash: 99% logged out":"Hash aplikasi anda sendiri: 99% log keluar","Your own new pair":"Pasangan baharu anda sendiri","Your own pair":"Pasangan anda sendiri","Your session key never leaves your server":"Kunci sesi anda tidak pernah meninggalkan pelayan anda","accepted":"diterima","account.getAuthorizations":"account.getAuthorizations","auth.sendCode: api_id, api_hash":"auth.sendCode: api_id, api_hash","checks and signs":"semak dan tandatangani","edited":"disunting","files per connection":"fail setiap sambungan","in total":"jumlah keseluruhan","initConnection":"inisiasi sambungan","opentele: TelegramClient":"opentele: TelegramClient","opentele: official app APIs":"opentele: API aplikasi rasmi","optional":"pilihan","or":"atau","per JSON object":"per objek JSON","per session text file":"fail teks per sesi","publishes":"menyebarkan","refused":"ditolak","signed":"ditandatangani","signed post":"pos bertandatangan","<a href=\"/guide.html#session-warning\">Read the session import warning</a>":"<a href=\"/guide.html#session-warning\">Baca amaran import sesi</a>","<a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/api/errors#406-not-acceptable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Telegram: duplicated authorization keys</a>":"<a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/api/errors#406-not-acceptable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Telegram: kunci kebenaran berganda</a>","A dedicated account is still recommended. It does not make parallel use of a copied key safe.":"Akaun khusus masih disyorkan. Menggunakan semula kunci kebenaran yang disalin dalam dua klien yang sedang berjalan kekal tidak selamat.","Copied session keys can be revoked":"Kunci sesi yang disalin boleh dibatalkan","For parallel use, sign in to TgWitness by phone or QR to create a separate authorization. Other separately authorized Telegram clients can remain signed in.":"Untuk penggunaan selari, log masuk ke TgWitness melalui telefon atau QR untuk mencipta kebenaran berasingan. Klien Telegram lain yang dibenarkan secara berasingan boleh kekal log masuk.","Fully quit Telegram Desktop, including its tray process, before copying or importing TData. Keep that copy of Desktop closed while TgWitness uses the imported session. The same rule applies to any other client whose session you import.":"Tutup sepenuhnya Telegram Desktop, termasuk proses bar tray-nya, sebelum menyalin atau mengimport TData. Biarkan salinan Desktop itu tertutup semasa TgWitness menggunakan sesi yang diimport. Peraturan yang sama terpakai kepada mana-mana klien lain yang sesi anda import.","Fully quit the original client and keep it closed while using its imported session. For parallel use, sign in to TgWitness by phone or QR to create a separate authorization; other separately authorized clients can remain signed in.":"Tutup sepenuhnya klien asal dan biarkan ia tertutup semasa menggunakan sesi yang diimport. Untuk penggunaan selari, log masuk ke TgWitness melalui telefon atau QR untuk mencipta kebenaran berasingan; klien lain yang dibenarkan secara berasingan boleh terus log masuk.","Importing TData, a session file, StringSession or Auth Key HEX reuses an existing authorization key. If Telegram detects parallel use of that key, it invalidates the authorization with <code>AUTH_KEY_DUPLICATED</code>. Both copies stop working and need a new login.":"Mengimport TData, fail sesi, StringSession atau Kunci Auth HEX menggunakan semula kunci kebenaran sedia ada. Jika Telegram mengesan penggunaan serentak kunci tersebut, ia akan membatalkan kebenaran dengan <code>AUTH_KEY_DUPLICATED</code>. Kedua-dua salinan berhenti berfungsi dan memerlukan log masuk baharu.","Parallel session warning":"Amaran sesi selari","Quit the application; do not log out or terminate the imported session in Telegram. Logging out or revoking that authorization also invalidates the copy used by TgWitness.":"Tinggalkan aplikasi; jangan log keluar atau menamatkan sesi yang diimport di Telegram. Melog keluar atau membatalkan kebenaran itu juga membatalkan salinan yang digunakan oleh TgWitness.","Rented +888 numbers (Fragment)":"Nombor +888 disewa (Fragment)","Running an imported TData/session key in Telegram Desktop and TgWitness at the same time can trigger <code>AUTH_KEY_DUPLICATED</code>. Telegram invalidates that authorization, so both copies need a new login. A dedicated account does not prevent this.":"Menggunakan kunci TData/session yang diimport dalam Telegram Desktop dan TgWitness pada masa yang sama boleh mencetuskan <code>AUTH_KEY_DUPLICATED</code>. Telegram membatalkan kebenaran itu, jadi kedua-dua salinan memerlukan log masuk baru. Akaun khusus tidak dapat menghalang perkara ini.","Ready-made accounts from marketplaces":"Akaun siap pakai dari pasaran","<a href=\"https://www.g2g.com/uk/categories/telegram-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">G2G: Telegram account listings</a>":"<a href=\"https://www.g2g.com/uk/categories/telegram-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">G2G: Senarai akaun Telegram</a>","<a href=\"https://www.z2u.com/telegram/accounts-5-15140\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Z2U: Telegram account listings</a>":"<a href=\"https://www.z2u.com/telegram/accounts-5-15140\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Z2U: Senarai akaun Telegram</a>","Warnings before purchase":"Amaran sebelum pembelian","If you use this option":"Jika anda menggunakan pilihan ini","Premium, deletion and the seven-day delay":"Premium, pemadaman dan kelewatan tujuh hari","Fresh accounts and API credentials":"Akaun baharu dan kelayakan API","Some marketplaces and services offer temporary rental of Telegram's official +888 numbers from Fragment.":"Sesetengah pasaran dan perkhidmatan menawarkan penyewaan sementara nombor +888 rasmi Telegram daripada Fragment.","Approximate price: US $20 per day.":"Anggaran harga: US $20 sehari.","You can register an account directly in Telegram Web or Telegram Desktop.":"Anda boleh mendaftar akaun terus di Telegram Web atau Telegram Desktop.","You can delete accounts on the number and create new ones.":"Anda boleh memadam akaun pada nombor tersebut dan mencipta yang baru.","These accounts generally face fewer anti-fraud checks, but they do not provide immunity or special privileges.":"Akaun-akaun ini umumnya menghadapi pemeriksaan anti-penipuan yang lebih sedikit, tetapi ia tidak memberikan imuniti atau keistimewaan khas.","The number is not yours. After the rental ends, the owner can reclaim it. Set a cloud password immediately and do not treat the account as long-term.":"Nombor ini bukan milik anda. Setelah tempoh sewaan tamat, pemilik boleh menuntutnya semula. Tetapkan kata laluan awan dengan segera dan jangan anggap akaun ini bersifat jangka panjang.","Owning the +888 yourself or using a prepaid SIM you control remains more reliable.":"Memiliki +888 sendiri atau menggunakan SIM prabayar yang anda kawal kekal lebih boleh dipercayai.","Some marketplaces (for example G2G or Z2U) sell ready-made Telegram accounts — new, aged, or with session files.":"Sesetengah pasaran (contohnya G2G atau Z2U) menjual akaun Telegram siap pakai — baharu, lama, atau dengan fail sesi.","NEVER USE YOUR MAIN ACCOUNT! A dedicated account obtained this way is still safer than putting your primary Telegram account into TgWitness.":"JANGAN PERNAH MENGGUNAKAN AKAUN UTAMA ANDA! Akaun khusus yang diperoleh dengan cara ini masih lebih selamat daripada memasukkan akaun Telegram utama anda ke dalam TgWitness.","This violates Telegram's Terms of Service.":"Ini melanggar Terma Perkhidmatan Telegram.","Many accounts are mass-registered (auto-reg) or have an unknown history.":"Banyak akaun didaftarkan secara besar-besaran (auto-reg) atau mempunyai sejarah yang tidak diketahui.","Some sellers may still have recovery access.":"Sesetengah penjual mungkin masih mempunyai akses pemulihan.","Accounts from such markets are frequently banned or restricted later.":"Akaun daripada pasaran sedemikian sering diharamkan atau dihadkan kemudian.","Avoid marketplaces that openly sell stealers, phishing tools, or clearly stolen accounts.":"Elakkan pasaran yang secara terbuka menjual perisian pencuri, alat pancingan, atau akaun yang jelas dicuri.","Buying an account — even one advertised as auto-reg — from platforms that openly sell phishing tools, stealers, stolen sessions or accounts violates not only Telegram's Terms of Service but also the laws of most countries. This can later invalidate your evidence. Choose carefully.":"Membeli akaun — walaupun yang diiklankan sebagai auto-reg — daripada platform yang secara terbuka menjual alat pancingan, pencuri, sesi curi atau akaun mencabul bukan sahaja Terma Perkhidmatan Telegram tetapi juga undang-undang kebanyakan negara. Ini boleh membatalkan bukti anda kemudian. Pilih dengan berhati-hati.","Treat the account as disposable.":"Anggap akaun ini boleh dibuang.","Terminate all other sessions, set a cloud password and change recovery methods immediately.":"Tamatkan semua sesi lain, tetapkan kata laluan awan dan ubah kaedah pemulihan dengan segera.","Use 2–3 accounts from different providers or accounts you registered yourself.":"Gunakan 2–3 akaun daripada penyedia berbeza atau akaun yang anda daftarkan sendiri.","If the account has Premium, someone with access to the phone number cannot delete the account immediately. You receive a notification and have seven days before deletion.":"Jika akaun mempunyai Premium, seseorang yang mempunyai akses kepada nombor telefon tidak boleh memadam akaun dengan segera. Anda akan menerima pemberitahuan dan mempunyai tujuh hari sebelum ia dipadamkan.","This matters because your investigation depends on the account: you have time to prepare a replacement.":"Ini penting kerana siasatan anda bergantung pada akaun ini: anda mempunyai masa untuk menyediakan pengganti.","If you obtain and use your own api_id/api_hash from a fresh account you registered yourself using a number from an SMS service, the account will be logged out on the first API request or session authorization. Keep this in mind when planning an investigation.":"Jika anda mendapatkan dan menggunakan api_id/api_hash anda sendiri daripada akaun baru yang anda daftarkan sendiri menggunakan nombor daripada perkhidmatan SMS, akaun tersebut akan log keluar pada permintaan API pertama atau kebenaran sesi. Perlu diingat perkara ini apabila merancang siasatan."};
